  SEN-101  sql_injection         Review the queries of the endpoint; use parameters, never text put together. (CWE-89, ATT&CK T1190)
  SEN-102  command_injection     Check the host for commands run by the web service; never pass input to a shell. (CWE-78, ATT&CK T1190)
