  SEN-201  brute_force           Lock the accounts tried and require a second factor. (CWE-307, ATT&CK T1110)
  SEN-202  login_after_failures  Treat the account as compromised: end its sessions and reset its password. (ATT&CK T1078)
  SEN-203  enumeration           Rate-limit requests that are answered 404. (ATT&CK T1595.003)
  SEN-301  hidden_text           Open the line with a tool that shows every character before trusting it. (CWE-117, ATT&CK T1036.002)
  SEN-302  oversized_line        Limit the length of a request at the proxy. (CWE-400)
